<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;line-height:1.7;max-width:860px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 28px}
h1{font-size:22pt;color:#111827;border-bottom:3px solid #c5a028;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
h2{font-size:14pt;color:#111827;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:4px;border-left:4px solid #4fd1c5;padding-left:12px;background:#f4fdfc}
h3{font-size:12pt;color:#374151;margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:bold}
p{margin:4px 0 10px}
.meta{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:10pt}
.meta p{margin:3px 0}
.meta strong{color:#b7881c}
.sec{border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;margin:10px 0}
.card-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11.5pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 4px}
.card-sub{font-size:10pt;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 4px;font-style:italic}
.card-desc{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}
.step-num{font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold;color:#c5a028;min-width:40px;line-height:1}
.step-body .step-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 3px}
.step-body .step-desc{font-size:10.5pt;color:#374151;margin:0}
.faq{border-left:3px solid #4fd1c5;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.faq-q{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;margin:0 0 5px}
.faq-a{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.cta{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;margin-top:28px}
.cta h2{color:#4fd1c5;border:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 8px;background:transparent;font-size:15pt}
.cta p{color:#d1d5db;margin:4px 0}
.cta .btn{display:inline-block;background:#4fd1c5;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:5px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10pt}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:10.5pt}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}
td:first-child{color:#6b7280}
td:last-child{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;text-align:right}
ul{padding-left:18px}
ul li{padding:2px 0;color:#374151}
</style></head><body><h1>Services</h1><div class="meta"><p><strong>Page Title:</strong> Mortgage Services | Madison, WI Home Loan Strategy | Rob Miller</p><p><strong>Meta Description:</strong> Explore our comprehensive mortgage services in Madison, WI. Rob Miller provides expert strategy for purchase, refinance, credit consulting, calculators, and custom equity planning.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Service Cards</h2><div class="card"><p class="card-title">First-Time Buyers</p><p class="card-desc">Expert guidance, WHEDA down payment assistance, and credit strategy. We make buying your first Wisconsin home simple and stress-free.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: First-Time Buyer Guide →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Purchase a New Home</p><p class="card-desc">Get a verified pre-approval that local realtors respect. Win in Madison's competitive real estate market with fast closing timelines.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Purchase Strategies →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Refinance Your Home</p><p class="card-desc">Lower your monthly payment, drop private mortgage insurance (PMI), or pull cash out for renovations with current interest rates.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Refinance Options →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Mortgage Calculator</p><p class="card-desc">Calculate estimated monthly principal, interest, taxes, and insurance payments. Analyze cash-to-close and purchase power instantly.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Calculate Payments →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Mortgage Planning</p><p class="card-desc">A comprehensive financial review. We design a personalized 5-year mortgage plan optimized for your long-term wealth building.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Mortgage Planning →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Annual Mortgage Review</p><p class="card-desc">Keep your financing optimized. We analyze your home equity, current interest rates, and local market values to ensure your loan fits.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Schedule Review →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Credit Consultation</p><p class="card-desc">Actionable steps to optimize your credit profile. Improve credit scores to secure lower interest rates and better loan programs.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Optimize Credit →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Home Equity Strategy</p><p class="card-desc">Unlock your home's equity. Explore cash-out refinancing, home equity lines of credit (HELOC), and structured investment strategies.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Equity Options →</em></p></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Planning Pillars</h2><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Points & Fee Analysis</p><p class="card-desc">We model rate-buy downs to calculate exact break-even points, ensuring you do not pay points that you will not recover.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Private Mortgage Insurance (PMI)</p><p class="card-desc">We map strategies to drop PMI early through amortization, principal buy-downs, or regional property value appreciation updates.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Equity Acceleration</p><p class="card-desc">Explore custom bi-weekly payment timelines and principal curtailments that pay off your loan years early and save thousands in interest.</p></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Planning Tools</h2><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Payment Calculator</p><p class="card-desc">Compute principal, interest, taxes, and insurance.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Purchase Power</p><p class="card-desc">Determine budget based on debt-to-income limits.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Refinance Break-Even</p><p class="card-desc">Calculate rate changes and closing cost break-evens.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Extra Amortization</p><p class="card-desc">Model extra payments to see interest savings.</p></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Hero Section</h2><h3>MORTGAGE SERVICES.</h3><p>We provide tailored home loan strategies, interactive planning tools, and local Wisconsin expertise designed to secure your financial future.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Main Page Content</h2><h3>5-YEAR MORTGAGE PLANNING STRATEGY.</h3><h3>INTERACTIVE CALCULATORS.</h3><h3>MEET OUR MORTGAGE SERVICES.</h3><p>A mortgage is not a transaction — it is a debt-management strategy. Our team evaluates your mortgage options through three wealth pillars.</p><p>Model your home loan variables directly. Use our custom planning tools to calculate payments, estimate purchase budgets, evaluate rate refinances, and model amortization timelines.</p><p>Explore our core advisory services, specialized loan program alignments, and planning tools.</p></div></body></html>